# Diagrams are live documents, never build input. In single-file mode every diagram is
# written beside graph.json, so root-level JSON is a diagram unless it is one of the configs
# named below — the same reasoning as .gitignore. Keep the two lists in step.
.crosspoint
diagrams
*.ops.jsonl
*.state.json
**/*.ops.jsonl
**/*.state.json
graph.json
/*.json
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/tsconfig.json
